                "contentText": {
                 "runs": [
                  {
                   "text": "!! 6th Anniversary Goods NOW ON SALE ! \n\nFinally an official happi?! I had a lot of input with the design!! grab yours while you can!! I want to see you guys wearing it for an eventual Japan tour…fingers crossed…plus, with all the Plushies I’ve released, now there’s an official bag to put them in! It’s got a penlight holder, too! Not to mention an official deadbeat headband for season 2 of Mori Calliope.\n\nAnd…for the first time ever, these will be arriving earlier than usual!! Late February…what timing, eh? What usually happens in March? Hmmm…\n\nSales run until October 19th so don’t miss out!\nLimited editions are sold out on GeekJack but still a few left on the Hololive shop!! Hope all deadbeats who want a signed version can get one! There may be less available next time due to wanting to give my wrist a rest so now may be the time to grab one if you’ve always wanted one! \n\nAVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE HERE!!\n\n▼hololive production OFFICIAL SHOP\nJP: "
                  },
                  {
                   "text": "https://shop.hololivepro.com/products...",
